// SO6 body with five leads: there is no pin 2. The LED is current-driven, so
// its anode and cathode carry no arrow. The output is an inverter: LED on
// drives VO low.
part TLP2361 {
    @~footprint    = SO-5-6-TOSHIBA;
    #value         = TLP2361;
    @!type         = optocoupler;
    #~mpn          = "TLP2361(TPL,E";
    #!manufacturer = "Toshiba";
    #~lcsc         = "C107626";

    1 : A;
    3 : K;
    4 : GND< &TYPE=POWER;
    5 : VO>  #VOH=2V3 #VOL=0V4;
    6 : VCC< &TYPE=POWER;
};

---

# TLP2361

**Source:** Toshiba, TLP2361 datasheet, Rev. 5.0, 2015-11-02. SO6 package
(five leads).

High-speed photocoupler: GaAlAs LED coupled to a high-gain photodetector with a
totem-pole output. Inverter logic. Internal Faraday shield.

## Pins (§4)

| Pin | Name | Function |
|---|---|---|
| 1 | Anode | LED anode |
| 3 | Cathode | LED cathode |
| 4 | GND | Output-side ground |
| 5 | VO | Output |
| 6 | VCC | Output-side supply |

There is no pin 2.

## Truth table (§6.1)

| Input | LED | Output |
|---|---|---|
| H | ON | L |
| L | OFF | H |

## Absolute maximum ratings (§7)

| Parameter | Value |
|---|---|
| Input forward current IF | 10 mA |
| Input reverse voltage | 5 V |
| Supply voltage VCC | 6 V |
| Output voltage VO | 6 V |
| Output current IO | 10 mA |
| Operating temperature | −40 to 125 °C |
| Isolation voltage BVS, AC 60 s | 3750 Vrms |

## Recommended operating conditions (§8)

| Parameter | Min | Typ | Max | Unit |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| Input on-state current IF(ON) | 2 | | 6 | mA |
| Input off-state voltage VF(OFF) | 0 | | 0.8 | V |
| Supply voltage VCC | 2.7 | 3.3 / 5.0 | 5.5 | V |

## Electrical characteristics (Ta = −40 to 125 °C, VCC = 2.7 to 5.5 V, §9)

| Parameter | Condition | Min | Typ | Max | Unit |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| Input forward voltage VF | IF = 2 mA, 25 °C | 1.35 | 1.50 | 1.65 | V |
| VOL | IF = 2 mA, IO = 3.2 mA | | 0.12 | 0.4 | V |
| VOH | VF = 0.8 V, IO = −3.2 mA, VCC = 3.3 V | 2.3 | 3.15 | | V |
| VOH | VF = 0.8 V, IO = −3.2 mA, VCC = 5 V | 4.0 | 4.87 | | V |
| Supply current ICCL, ICCH | | | 0.65 | 1.0 | mA |
| Threshold input current IFHL | Ta ≤ 105 °C | | 0.5 | 1.3 | mA |
| Threshold input current IFHL | Ta ≤ 125 °C | | 0.5 | 1.6 | mA |
| Data rate | NRZ | | 15 | | MBd |
| Common-mode transient immunity | | ±20 | | | kV/µs |

## Application

A 0.1 µF ceramic bypass capacitor must be connected between pin 6 and pin 4,
placed within 1 cm of each pin, or the device may not switch properly. Input
current rise and fall times should be under 0.5 µs.

## Package

SO6 (5-lead), 3.7 × 4.55 mm body, 1.27 mm pitch. Pins 1 and 3 on the input
side, 4–6 on the output side.
